{"collection_no":"36985","record_type":"col","lng":2.916667,"lat":42.633331,"collection_name":"Villeneuve de la Raho","collection_aka":"Villeneuve-de-la-Raho","n_occs":8,"early_interval":"Zanclean","late_interval":"Piacenzian","max_ma":5.333,"min_ma":2.58,"reference_no":"9891","cc":"FR","state":"Languedoc-Roussillon Region","latlng_basis":"based on nearby landmark","latlng_precision":"minutes","altitude_value":"25","altitude_unit":"meters","geogscale":"small collection","geogcomments":"The site is located in the territory of the commune of Villeneuve de la Raho,\nin the south of the village, at the foot of the butte near the reserve. The locality is limited to an approximately 4 meter square area. Coordinates: X: 647,40; Y: 37,35","environment":"fluvial-lacustrine indet.","primary_reference":"J. Aymar. 1992. Note sur la découverte d'une tortue nouvelle \"Chelydropsis sp.\" dans le Pliocene roussillonnais (Ruscinien). [Note on the discovery of a new turtle, \"Chelydropsis sp., in the Pliocene from Roussillon, Ruscinian.]. Naturalia Ruscinonensia, Perpignan : Societe d'Historie Naturelle de Perpignan et des Pyreneennes-Orientales 2:27-32"},
{"collection_no":"37047","record_type":"col","lng":5.450000,"lat":43.783333,"collection_name":"Cucuron, at the stadium, sample taken between 1972 and 1976","n_occs":17,"early_interval":"MN 12","max_ma":7.9,"min_ma":6.965,"reference_no":"9926","cc":"FR","state":"Provence-Alpes-Cote d'Azur Region","county":"Vaucluse Departement","latlng_basis":"based on nearby landmark","latlng_precision":"minutes","geogscale":"outcrop","geogcomments":"at the level of the stadium (that was under construction at that time) in the town of Cucuron, near Reillanne (Vaucluse). IGN map at 1/50 000, XXXII-42, x = 849,67; y = 3168,68.","environment":"lacustrine indet.","primary_reference":"P. Mein and J. Michaux. 1979. Une faune de petits mammiferes d'age Turolien moyen (Miocene superieur) a Cucuron (Vaucluse); donnees nouvelles sur le genre Stephanomys (Rodentia) et consequences stratigraphiques. Géobios 12(3):481-485","formation":"Ravin de Ratavoux"},
