{"collection_no":"203355","record_type":"col","lng":7.491667,"lat":48.577778,"collection_name":"Soultz-les-Bains (Grès argileux Mb.)","n_occs":14,"early_interval":"Anisian","max_ma":247,"min_ma":241.464,"reference_no":"69734","cc":"FR","state":"Grand Est","county":"Bas-Rhin","latlng_basis":"based on nearby landmark","latlng_precision":"seconds","geogscale":"outcrop","geogcomments":"\"‘Carriere royale’ quarry (‘Konigsgrube’) near Soultz-les-Bains (Sulzbad, west of Strasbourg; N 48°34'35'', E 7°29'30'').\" \"The quarry near Soultz-les Bains is the classical 19th century locality, from where Schimper’s material was collected, including several specimens described as Apudites antiquus (Schimper 1840, 1853, pl. 3), which were the earliest fossils subsequently attributed to the modern notostracan genus, Triops.\"","environment":"lacustrine - small","primary_reference":"E. Kittl. 1912. Materialen zu einer Monographie der Halobiidae und Monotidae der Trias [Monograph on the Halobiidae and Monotidae of the Triassic]. Resultate der Wissenschaftlichen Erforschung des Balatonsees, II Band: Paläontologie der Umgebung des Balatonsees 1(4):1-229","formation":"Grès à Voltzia","geological_group":"Buntsandstein","member":"Grès argileux"},
