{"collection_no":"276442","record_type":"col","lng":2.754500,"lat":49.531502,"collection_name":"Ressons-sur-Matz","n_occs":28,"early_interval":"Thanetian","max_ma":59.24,"min_ma":56,"reference_no":"93717","cc":"FR","latlng_basis":"stated in text","latlng_precision":"4","geogscale":"outcrop","geogcomments":"Oise (X = 630.250, Y = 203.600), located on the left side of the departmental road D15 from Ressons-sur-Matz to Margny-sur-Matz, at the edge of the village, in a former sand quarry now hidden by vegetation.","environment":"coastal indet.","primary_reference":"J. Baut and B. Génault. 1995. Contribution à l'étude des élasmobranches du Thanétien (Paléocène) du Bassin de Paris. 1. Découverte d'une faune d'elasmobranches dans la partie supérieure des Sables de Bracheux (Thanétien, Paléocène du Bassin de Paris) des régions de Compiègne (Oise) et de Montdidier (Somme). Belgian Geological Survey, Professional Paper, Elasmobranches et Stratigraphie 278:185-259","formation":"Sables de Bracheux"},
{"collection_no":"276443","record_type":"col","lng":2.762500,"lat":49.528000,"collection_name":"Margny-sur-Matz","n_occs":10,"early_interval":"Thanetian","max_ma":59.24,"min_ma":56,"reference_no":"93717","cc":"FR","latlng_basis":"stated in text","latlng_precision":"4","geogscale":"outcrop","geogcomments":"Oise (X = 630.850, Y = 203.200). This former sand quarry, also located on the edge of the D15, a few hundred meters from the Ressons-sur-Matz locality.","environment":"coastal indet.","primary_reference":"J. Baut and B. Génault. 1995. Contribution à l'étude des élasmobranches du Thanétien (Paléocène) du Bassin de Paris. 1. Découverte d'une faune d'elasmobranches dans la partie supérieure des Sables de Bracheux (Thanétien, Paléocène du Bassin de Paris) des régions de Compiègne (Oise) et de Montdidier (Somme). Belgian Geological Survey, Professional Paper, Elasmobranches et Stratigraphie 278:185-259","formation":"Sables de Bracheux"},
{"collection_no":"276444","record_type":"col","lng":2.834000,"lat":49.507500,"collection_name":"Elincourt-Ste-Marguerite","n_occs":23,"early_interval":"Thanetian","max_ma":59.24,"min_ma":56,"reference_no":"93717","cc":"FR","latlng_basis":"stated in text","latlng_precision":"4","geogscale":"outcrop","geogcomments":"Oise (X = 636.050, Y = 201.000). Former sand quarry operation located on the edge of the D15 departmental road, between Margny-sur-Matz and Elincourt-Ste-Marguerite. The lower part of the quarry face, hidden by landslides, is no longer accessible. The upper part, clearly exposed to a height of approximately 4 meters, presents a relatively extensive quarry face.","environment":"coastal indet.","primary_reference":"J. Baut and B. Génault. 1995. Contribution à l'étude des élasmobranches du Thanétien (Paléocène) du Bassin de Paris. 1. Découverte d'une faune d'elasmobranches dans la partie supérieure des Sables de Bracheux (Thanétien, Paléocène du Bassin de Paris) des régions de Compiègne (Oise) et de Montdidier (Somme). Belgian Geological Survey, Professional Paper, Elasmobranches et Stratigraphie 278:185-259","formation":"Sables de Bracheux"},
{"collection_no":"276445","record_type":"col","lng":2.754300,"lat":49.499500,"collection_name":"Antheuil-Portes","n_occs":7,"early_interval":"Thanetian","max_ma":59.24,"min_ma":56,"reference_no":"93717","cc":"FR","latlng_basis":"stated in text","latlng_precision":"4","geogscale":"outcrop","geogcomments":"Oise (X = 630.260, Y = 200.400). This former sand quarry is located at the exit of Antheuil-Portes, on the right of the road leading to Marquéglise, just before the railway crossing. This quarry, already noted and studied by Rouvillois (1960), presents a fine section in the upper part of the Sables de Bracheux.","environment":"coastal indet.","primary_reference":"J. Baut and B. Génault. 1995. Contribution à l'étude des élasmobranches du Thanétien (Paléocène) du Bassin de Paris. 1. Découverte d'une faune d'elasmobranches dans la partie supérieure des Sables de Bracheux (Thanétien, Paléocène du Bassin de Paris) des régions de Compiègne (Oise) et de Montdidier (Somme). Belgian Geological Survey, Professional Paper, Elasmobranches et Stratigraphie 278:185-259","formation":"Sables de Bracheux"},
{"collection_no":"276446","record_type":"col","lng":2.650000,"lat":49.577999,"collection_name":"Rollot","n_occs":28,"early_interval":"Thanetian","max_ma":59.24,"min_ma":56,"reference_no":"93717","cc":"FR","latlng_basis":"stated in text","latlng_precision":"3","geogscale":"outcrop","geogcomments":"Somme (X = 622.650, Y = 208.750). This important sand quarry, located at the exit of Rollot, on the edge of the D27 road leading to Courcelles-Epayelles, was filled in 1993. It presented a fine section of the Thanetian over about ten meters, from the transgressive sandy levels on the chalk, up to the upper limestone levels.","environment":"coastal indet.","primary_reference":"J. Baut and B. Génault. 1995. Contribution à l'étude des élasmobranches du Thanétien (Paléocène) du Bassin de Paris. 1. Découverte d'une faune d'elasmobranches dans la partie supérieure des Sables de Bracheux (Thanétien, Paléocène du Bassin de Paris) des régions de Compiègne (Oise) et de Montdidier (Somme). Belgian Geological Survey, Professional Paper, Elasmobranches et Stratigraphie 278:185-259","formation":"Sables de Bracheux"},
